"title":"Oaktree Strategic Credit Fund original2026 SEC schedule","published_date":null,"source_type":"investor_announcement"}],"investors":[{"slug":"oaktree-specialty-lending-corporation","name":"Oaktree Specialty Lending Corporation","entity_type":"Business development company","role":"lender","source_index":0}],"note_en":"Original Oaktree2025-08-05 call reports senior refinancing for DrakenInternational with total USD217m reporting commitment/USD177m fundedupfront and OCSL reporting allocation. Original2026 SEC schedule explicitly names DrakenInternationalLLC as borrower of both GBP and USD first-lien positions, corroborating actual issuer. Multicurrency original facility totals are not established, so amount/currency areNULL and reporting-currency aggregates are preserved here only. OCSL is an explicitly allocated lender; individual translated balances are not inferred original contributions. Earliest public day and exact closing date remain unknown; originalSEC holdings do not create another round.","coverage_note_en":"Source-audited public financing subset. Original issuer/instrument/date/currency and allocation limits remain explicit; no cumulative total or complete private-history claim."},{"company_slug":"drone-nerds","round_key":"revolving-credit-facility-2022","stage":"Original revolving credit facility","amount":19500000,"currency":"USD","announced_date":null,"financing_type":"debt","record_kind":"credit_facility","amount_basis":"announced_round_size","closing_status":"signed","amount_qualifier":"up_to","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000121390025108855/ea026472201ex99-3_xtiaero.htm","title":"Drone Nerds audited2024 statements, Note6","published_date":"2025-11-12","source_type":"company_announcement"}],"investors":[],"note_en":"Drone Nerds Inc. agreed USD19.5m capacity in December2022; unnamed lender. Inc.toLLC continuity established in original reorganization note; no cash draw inferred.","coverage_note_en":"Original financial disclosures verified; historical first-public dates remain unknown. Limits/refinancing are not cumulative funding."},{"company_slug":"drone-nerds","round_key":"revolving-credit-facility-amendment-2024","stage":"Amended revolving credit facility","amount":25000000,"currency":"USD","announced_date":null,"financing_type":"debt","record_kind":"credit_facility","amount_basis":"announced_round_size","closing_status":"signed","amount_qualifier":"up_to","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000121390025108855/ea026472201ex99-3_xtiaero.htm","title":"Drone Nerds audited2024 statements, Note6","published_date":"2025-11-12","source_type":"company_announcement"}],"investors":[],"note_en":"July2024 replacement capacity USD25m; not incremental USD25m. Unnamed bank; first public announcement date unknown.","coverage_note_en":"Original financial disclosures verified; historical first-public dates remain unknown. Limits/refinancing are not cumulative funding."},{"company_slug":"drone-nerds","round_key":"revolving-credit-facility-reduction-2025-06","stage":"Revolving facility reduction and waiver","amount":10000000,"currency":"USD","announced_date":null,"financing_type":"debt","record_kind":"investment_disclosure","amount_basis":"announced_round_size","closing_status":"signed","amount_qualifier":"up_to","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000121390026004167/ea027235901ex99-1_xtiaero.htm","title":"Drone Nerds original2025 statements, Note7","published_date":"2026-01-14","source_type":"company_announcement"}],"investors":[],"note_en":"June2025 waiver reduced capacity fromUSD25m toUSD10m. This renegotiation adds no new money; lender unnamed.","coverage_note_en":"Original financial disclosures verified; historical first-public dates remain unknown. Limits/refinancing are not cumulative funding."},{"company_slug":"drone-nerds","round_key":"equity-injection-2025-06","stage":"Required equity injection","amount":1000000,"currency":"USD","announced_date":null,"financing_type":"equity","record_kind":"round","amount_basis":"closed_amount","closing_status":"closed","amount_qualifier":"approximate","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000121390026004167/ea027235901ex99-1_xtiaero.htm","title":"Drone Nerds original2025 statements, Note7","published_date":"2026-01-14","source_type":"company_announcement"}],"investors":[],"note_en":"ApproximatelyUSD1m equity injection is explicitly included in stockholders equity following June2025 waiver. Contributors and securities details undisclosed.","coverage_note_en":"Original financial disclosures verified; historical first-public dates remain unknown. Limits/refinancing are not cumulative funding."},{"company_slug":"drone-nerds","round_key":"replacement-revolving-credit-facility-2025-07","stage":"Replacement revolving credit facility","amount":25000000,"currency":"USD","announced_date":null,"financing_type":"debt","record_kind":"credit_facility","amount_basis":"announced_round_size","closing_status":"signed","amount_qualifier":"up_to","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000121390026004167/ea027235901ex99-1_xtiaero.htm","title":"Drone Nerds original2025 statements, Note7","published_date":"2026-01-14","source_type":"company_announcement"}],"investors":[],"note_en":"July2025 new lender provided replacement USD25m capacity throughJuly2027. Not cash received or additive net capital; bank unnamed.","coverage_note_en":"Original financial disclosures verified; historical first-public dates remain unknown. Limits/refinancing are not cumulative funding."},{"company_slug":"drone-nerds","round_key":"joint-jpmorgan-abl-credit-facility-2026","stage":"Joint secured asset-based revolving facility","amount":20000000,"currency":"USD","announced_date":"2026-02-17","financing_type":"debt","record_kind":"credit_facility","amount_basis":"announced_round_size","closing_status":"signed","amount_qualifier":"up_to","research_status":"partial","checked_at":"2026-11-15","publication_status":"approved","sources":[{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000121390026016941/ea0277245-8k_xti.htm","title":"Original February2026 credit8-K","published_date":"2026-02-17","source_type":"company_announcement"},{"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1529113/000162828026073407/xtia-20260930.htm","title":"Latest November2026 original10-Q: facility and waiver","published_date":"2026-11-12","source_type":"company_announcement"}],"investors":[{"slug":"jpmorgan-chase-bank-n-a","name":"JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A.","entity_type":"Bank","role":"lender","source_index":0,"id":"0bee5c77-72aa-4e6d-9516-4262aff1474d"}],"note_en":"Drone Nerds LLC and Anzu Robotics are jointly/severally liable for one USD20m facility, signedFebruary11/publicly filedFebruary17. No borrower allocation or conditional accordion added; November2026 waiver creates no new capacity.","coverage_note_en":"Original financial disclosures verified; historical first-public dates remain unknown. Limits/refinancing are not cumulative funding."}],"relationships":[{"company_slug":"dg-solone-drone-technologies","investor":{"slug":"sol-one","name":"Sol.One (Sol1 BV)","entity_type":"Corporate investor"},"source":{"url":"https://www.sol.one/blog/newsroom-7/sol-one-enters-india-with-dg-sol-one-21","title":"Sol.One original DG Sol.One founding announcement","source_type":"company_announcement"},"note_en":"Original Sol.One announcement explicitly identifies Sol.One and DGVK Enterprises Private Limited as founders of the DG Sol.One joint venture. Generic ownership/founding relationship only; no share percentage, individual cash contribution, lead role or additional financing round inferred."},{"company_slug":"dg-solone-drone-technologies","investor":{"slug":"dgvk-enterprises","name":"DGVK Enterprises Private Limited","entity_type":"Corporate investor"},"source":{"url":"https://www.sol.one/blog/newsroom-7/sol-one-enters-india-with-dg-sol-one-21","title":"Sol.One original DG Sol.One founding announcement","source_type":"company_announcement"},"note_en":"Original Sol.One announcement explicitly identifies Sol.One and DGVK Enterprises Private Limited as founders of the DG Sol.One joint venture. Generic ownership/founding relationship only; no share percentage, individual cash contribution, lead role or additional financing round inferred."},{"company_slug":"dornier","investor":{"slug":"palero-group","name":"Palero Group","entity_type":"Investment group"},"source":{"url":"https://palero.de/en/homepage/","title":"palero original shareholder testimonial","published_date":null,"source_type":"investor_announcement"},"note_en":"Original palero Group shareholder testimonial and investment profile confirm historical shareholder support for infrastructure/engineering Dornier Group GmbH. No percentage, current continuing stake, cheque or round attribution inferred; separate from unrelated DornierSeawings ownership."}]}'::jsonb; matched integer; begin
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_research(research_id,slug,name,entity_type,evidence_status,evidence_status_label,evidence_basis,source_dataset,source_dataset_version,publication_status,map_ready,verified_as_of,approved_at,missing_fields) select distinct 'funding-research:'||(p->>'slug'),p->>'slug',p->>'name',p->>'entity_type','deal','Source-confirmed financing participant','primary_or_transaction_party',(select data->>'dataset' from input),(select data->>'checked_at' from input),'approved',false,(r->>'checked_at')::date,now(),array['Published offices','Fund size / manager AUM','Typical ticket size','Investment mandate'] from participants on conflict(slug) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_research(research_id,slug,name,entity_type,evidence_status,evidence_status_label,evidence_basis,source_dataset,source_dataset_version,publication_status,map_ready,verified_as_of,approved_at,missing_fields) select 'funding-research:'||(g->'investor'->>'slug'),g->'investor'->>'slug',g->'investor'->>'name',g->'investor'->>'entity_type','deal','Company-confirmed investor listing','company_published_investors',(select data->>'dataset' from input),(select data->>'checked_at' from input),'approved',false,(select(data->>'checked_at')::date from input),now(),array['Published offices','Round attribution','Individual contribution'] from generic on conflict(slug) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_funding_rounds(company_id,round_key,stage,financing_type,announced_date,amount,currency,amount_basis,closing_status,note_en,publication_status,checked_at,record_kind,parent_round_id,amount_qualifier) select c.id,r->>'round_key',r->>'stage',r->>'financing_type',r->>'announced_date',(r->>'amount')::numeric,r->>'currency',r->>'amount_basis',r->>'closing_status',r->>'note_en','approved',(r->>'checked_at')::date,coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round'),null::uuid,coalesce(r->>'amount_qualifier','exact') from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug'  where coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round')<>'extension' on conflict(company_id,round_key) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_funding_rounds(company_id,round_key,stage,financing_type,announced_date,amount,currency,amount_basis,closing_status,note_en,publication_status,checked_at,record_kind,parent_round_id,amount_qualifier) select c.id,r->>'round_key',r->>'stage',r->>'financing_type',r->>'announced_date',(r->>'amount')::numeric,r->>'currency',r->>'amount_basis',r->>'closing_status',r->>'note_en','approved',(r->>'checked_at')::date,coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round'),parent.id,coalesce(r->>'amount_qualifier','exact') from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds parent on parent.company_id=c.id and parent.round_key=r->>'parent_round_key' where coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round')='extension' on conflict(company_id,round_key) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_funding_round_sources(round_id,url,title,source_type,checked_at) select f.id,s->>'url',s->>'title',s->>'source_type',(r->>'checked_at')::date from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds f on f.company_id=c.id and f.round_key=r->>'round_key' cross join lateral jsonb_array_elements(r->'sources') s on conflict(round_id,url) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_funding_round_investors(round_id,investor_research_id,role,source_url,checked_at,contribution_amount,contribution_currency) select f.id,i.id,p->>'role',r->'sources'->((p->>'source_index')::int)->>'url',(r->>'checked_at')::date,(p->'contribution'->>'amount')::numeric,p->'contribution'->>'currency' from participants join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds f on f.company_id=c.id and f.round_key=r->>'round_key' join public.investor_research i on i.slug::text=p->>'slug' on conflict(round_id,investor_research_id) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_research_sources(investor_id,url,title,accessed_at) select distinct i.id,r->'sources'->((p->>'source_index')::int)->>'url',r->'sources'->((p->>'source_index')::int)->>'title',(r->>'checked_at')::date from participants join public.investor_research i on i.slug::text=p->>'slug' where not exists(select 1 from public.investor_research_sources ex where ex.investor_id=i.id and ex.url=r->'sources'->((p->>'source_index')::int)->>'url' and ex.location_id is null) on conflict do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_companies(investor_research_id,company_id,relationship_type,evidence_status,source_url,reviewed_at,portfolio_name_as_published,match_method,match_note_en) select i.id,c.id,'portfolio_listed','company_published_investors',g->'source'->>'url',(select(data->>'checked_at')::date from input),c.name,'manual',g->>'note_en' from generic join public.investor_research i on i.slug::text=g->'investor'->>'slug' join public.companies c on c.slug::text=g->>'company_slug' on conflict(investor_research_id,company_id,relationship_type) do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.investor_research_sources(investor_id,url,title,accessed_at) select distinct i.id,g->'source'->>'url',g->'source'->>'title',(select(data->>'checked_at')::date from input) from generic join public.investor_research i on i.slug::text=g->'investor'->>'slug' where not exists(select 1 from public.investor_research_sources ex where ex.investor_id=i.id and ex.url=g->'source'->>'url' and ex.location_id is null) on conflict do nothing;
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) insert into public.company_investment_research(company_id,coverage_status,coverage_note_en,checked_at,source_urls) select c.id,'partial',min(r->>'coverage_note_en'),max((r->>'checked_at')::date),array_agg(distinct s->>'url') from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' cross join lateral jsonb_array_elements(r->'sources') s group by c.id on conflict(company_id) do update set coverage_note_en=excluded.coverage_note_en,checked_at=excluded.checked_at,source_urls=(select array_agg(distinct u order by u) from unnest(company_investment_research.source_urls||excluded.source_urls) u),updated_at=now() where company_investment_research.coverage_status='partial' and (select data->>'dataset' from input)<>'company-funding-pilot-v1';
with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) select count(*) into matched from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds f on f.company_id=c.id and f.round_key=r->>'round_key'; if matched<>12 then raise exception 'Manifest events did not all resolve';end if; if exists(with input as(select funding_payload as data), rounds as(select value r from input,jsonb_array_elements(data->'rounds')), participants as(select r,value p from rounds,jsonb_array_elements(r->'investors')), generic as(select value g from input,jsonb_array_elements(coalesce(data->'relationships','[]'::jsonb))) select 1 from rounds join public.companies c on c.slug::text=r->>'company_slug' join public.company_funding_rounds f on f.company_id=c.id and f.round_key=r->>'round_key' where row(f.stage,f.financing_type,f.announced_date,f.amount,f.currency::text,f.amount_basis,f.closing_status,f.record_kind,f.amount_qualifier) is distinct from row(r->>'stage',r->>'financing_type',r->>'announced_date',(r->>'amount')::numeric,r->>'currency',r->>'amount_basis',r->>'closing_status',coalesce(r->>'record_kind','round'),coalesce(r->>'amount_qualifier','exact'))) then raise exception 'Manifest conflicts with stored event: review instead of overwriting';end if;end $funding_import$;